{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50206","headline":"秋夜怀友 · 马吉甫","name":"秋夜怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人在天末，空庭明月时。\n白云劳悟（寤）寐，芳树歇华滋。\n蟋蟀鸣秋草，蜘蛛弄晓丝。\n菊花应可泛，留兴待□□。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马吉甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}